{"id":"da378af7f2f57e43","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-signature-size.md","title":"Cardinality of a First-Order Signature","display":"df-signature-size — Cardinality of a First-Order Signature","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-signature-size","aliases":["88-df-signature-size"],"display":"df-signature-size — Cardinality of a First-Order Signature","depends_on":["[[88-df-language]]","[[88-df-symbol]]","[[88-df-cardinality]]","[[88-df-countable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-signature-size"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-signature-size</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-signature-size — Cardinality of a First-Order Signature"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"99f4e6abf02e07ae\" href=\"?note=99f4e6abf02e07ae\" title=\"88-df-language\">88-df-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0f1e525f3e037509\" href=\"?note=0f1e525f3e037509\" title=\"88-df-symbol\">88-df-symbol</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3fb55f9cf4d73400\" href=\"?note=3fb55f9cf4d73400\" title=\"88-df-cardinality\">88-df-cardinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dba31c144607e57b\" href=\"?note=dba31c144607e57b\" title=\"88-df-countable\">88-df-countable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为候选一阶签名；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Language}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Language}(S)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"99f4e6abf02e07ae\" href=\"?note=99f4e6abf02e07ae\" title=\"88-df-language\">88-df-language</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Const}_S,\\mathrm{Func}_S^n,\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n,\\mathrm{NLSym}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Const}_S,\\mathrm{Func}_S^n,\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n,\\mathrm{NLSym}_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0f1e525f3e037509\" href=\"?note=0f1e525f3e037509\" title=\"88-df-symbol\">88-df-symbol</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|X|\">\\(|X|\\)</span> 为集合基数，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3fb55f9cf4d73400\" href=\"?note=3fb55f9cf4d73400\" title=\"88-df-cardinality\">88-df-cardinality</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"dba31c144607e57b\" href=\"?note=dba31c144607e57b\" title=\"88-df-countable\">88-df-countable</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{card}_{\\mathrm{sig}}(S)\">\\(\\operatorname{card}_{\\mathrm{sig}}(S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CountableLanguage}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{CountableLanguage}(S)\\)</span> 是本文件定义的签名大小与可数语言谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}signature\\text{-}size}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{card}_{\\mathrm{sig}}(S)\\coloneqq|\\mathrm{NLSym}_S|\n=\\left|\\mathrm{Const}_S\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\geq1}\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\n\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\geq1}\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\right|\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}signature\\text{-}size}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{card}_{\\mathrm{sig}}(S)\\coloneqq|\\mathrm{NLSym}_S|\n=\\left|\\mathrm{Const}_S\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\geq1}\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\n\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\geq1}\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\right|\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}signature\\text{-}size}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CountableLanguage}(S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Language}(S)\\land\\mathrm{Countable}(\\mathrm{NLSym}_S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}signature\\text{-}size}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CountableLanguage}(S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Language}(S)\\land\\mathrm{Countable}(\\mathrm{NLSym}_S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 在本册中是一个编码元组。元组本身作为集合的基数与其全部非逻辑符号的数目无关，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}(S)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|S|\">\\(|S|\\)</span> 不能用来表达模型论定理中的语言大小。</p>\n<p>变量集及固定逻辑符号集至多可数，所以公式集的基数界由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\max(\\operatorname{card}_{\\mathrm{sig}}(S),\\aleph_0)\">\\(\\max(\\operatorname{card}_{\\mathrm{sig}}(S),\\aleph_0)\\)</span> 给出。可数情形的完整语法联系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c03ee71a93771472\" href=\"?note=c03ee71a93771472\" title=\"88-lem-countable-syntax\">88-lem-countable-syntax</a>。本文件不改变原签名、变量、项或公式的定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"99f4e6abf02e07ae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-symbol","status":"resolved","id":"0f1e525f3e037509","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-symbol]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"3fb55f9cf4d73400","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-countable","status":"resolved","id":"dba31c144607e57b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-countable]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"99f4e6abf02e07ae","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 为候选一阶签名；$\\mathrm{Language}(S)$ 见 [[88-df-language]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-symbol","status":"resolved","id":"0f1e525f3e037509","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Const}_S,\\mathrm{Func}_S^n,\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n,\\mathrm{NLSym}_S$ 见 [[88-df-symbol]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"3fb55f9cf4d73400","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|X|$ 为集合基数，见 [[88-df-cardinality]]；$\\mathrm{Countable}$ 见 [[88-df-countable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-countable","status":"resolved","id":"dba31c144607e57b","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|X|$ 为集合基数，见 [[88-df-cardinality]]；$\\mathrm{Countable}$ 见 [[88-df-countable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-lem-countable-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"c03ee71a93771472","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"变量集及固定逻辑符号集至多可数，所以公式集的基数界由 $\\max(\\operatorname{card}_{\\mathrm{sig}}(S),\\aleph_0)$ 给出。可数情形的完整语法联系见 [[88-lem-countable-syntax]]。本文件不改变原签名、变量、项或公式的定义。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Language}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Const}_S,\\mathrm{Func}_S^n,\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n,\\mathrm{NLSym}_S","display":false},{"tex":"|X|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Countable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{card}_{\\mathrm{sig}}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CountableLanguage}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}signature\\text{-}size}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{card}_{\\mathrm{sig}}(S)\\coloneqq|\\mathrm{NLSym}_S|\n=\\left|\\mathrm{Const}_S\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\geq1}\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\n\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\geq1}\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\right|","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}signature\\text{-}size}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CountableLanguage}(S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Language}(S)\\land\\mathrm{Countable}(\\mathrm{NLSym}_S)","display":true},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Countable}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"|S|","display":false},{"tex":"\\max(\\operatorname{card}_{\\mathrm{sig}}(S),\\aleph_0)","display":false}],"bytes":1709,"backlinks":[{"id":"c03ee71a93771472","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CountableLanguage}(S)$ 见 [[88-df-signature-size]]；$\\mathrm{NLSym}_S$ 见 [[88-df-symbol]]。"},{"id":"f2443cf5aaedca0d","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 是候选签名；$\\mathrm{Language}(S)$ 见 [[88-df-language]]；$\\mathrm{CountableLanguage}(S)$ 见 [[88-df-signature-size]]。"},{"id":"4df32d0a7ee8d3b6","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"背景理论为 ZFC。$\\mathrm{Language}(S)$ 见 [[88-df-language]]；$\\operatorname{card}_{\\mathrm{sig}}(S),\\mathrm{CountableLanguage}(S)$ 见 [[88-df-signature-size]]。"},{"id":"3bc949095b085182","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Language}(S)$ 见 [[88-df-language]]；$\\operatorname{card}_{\\mathrm{sig}}(S)$ 见 [[88-df-signature-size]]。"},{"id":"0d1300ef33ffd8df","anchor":"ref-172","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"| 可接受程序编号 | $\\mathrm{AcceptNum}_k(\\Phi_k)$、$\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)$ | [[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]] | 任意同元数有效满编号均有总可计算翻译；与有效性区分 |\n| 可枚举集的索引 | $W_e=\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)$、$W_{e,s}$ | [[88-df-ce-indexing]] | 自然数集合及一致可判定的有限阶段近似 |\n| 神谕规则图 | $F_e$、$\\mathrm{FunctionalRules}(F)$ | [[88-df-oracle-rules]] | 一致有效、相容单值且对初段扩张封闭；不再复用 W_e |\n| 神谕机对象 | $M_e^A=\\langle e,A,F_e\\rangle$ | [[88-df-oracle-tm]] | 以 Turing functional 表示，不冒充普通 TM 八元组 |\n| 神谕有限阶段 | $\\varphi_{e,s}^A$ | [[88-df-oracle-computation]] | 已接纳有限规则的求值；只在神谕固定时对阶段递增 |\n| 有效直和 | $\\bigoplus_k A_k$、$A\\oplus B$ | [[88-df-effective-join]] | 使用 enc 的列编码；有效性修饰编码而非输入集合 |\n| 唯一描述 | $\\iota x\\,\\phi$ | [[88-df-iota-operator]] | 逐公式、变量及完整自由参数的定义模式；唯一性失败取固定默认对象 |\n| 记号次序 | $<_{\\mathcal O_{88}}$ | [[88-df-ordinal-notation]] | 正生成规则的最小传递关系，不等于全部序数值比较 |\n| 有限迭代跳跃 | $A^{(0)}=A$、$A^{(n+1)}=(A^{(n)})'$ | [[88-df-turing-jump]] | 有正式递归定义的有限层记号 |\n| 优先构造数据 | $\\mathrm{PriorityData}(D,(A_s))$ | [[88-df-priority-method]] | 可计算有限阶段、最小注意策略、保护界与初始化均被定型 |\n| 有限损伤与成功 | $\\mathrm{FiniteInjury}(R,I)$、$\\mathrm{SuccessfulPriority}((A_s),R,I)$ | [[88-df-priority-method]] | 有限初始化次数与最终并集满足要求是不同条件 |\n| 可数语言 | $\\mathrm{CountableLanguage}(S)$、$\\operatorname{card}_{\\mathrm{sig}}(S)$ | [[88-df-signature-size]] | 统计全部非逻辑符号，而不是签名编码元组的元素个数 |"},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-125","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-ackermann-function.md]]\n[[88-df-alphabet.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-delta.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-pi.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-sigma.md]]\n[[88-df-assignment.md]]\n[[88-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-axiom.md]]\n[[88-df-bijective.md]]\n[[88-df-bound-variable.md]]\n[[88-df-bounded-quantifier.md]]\n[[88-df-canonical-model.md]]\n[[88-df-cardinality.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-indexing.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[88-df-church-turing-thesis.md]]\n[[88-df-classical-calculus.md]]\n[[88-df-closed-term.md]]\n[[88-df-compactness.md]]\n[[88-df-completeness.md]]\n[[88-df-computable-function.md]]\n[[88-df-consistent.md]]\n[[88-df-countable.md]]\n[[88-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[88-df-decidable-set.md]]\n[[88-df-defined.md]]\n[[88-df-delta0-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-delta1-set.md]]\n[[88-df-derivation.md]]\n[[88-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[88-df-effective-join.md]]\n[[88-df-effective-program-numbering.m